  "title": "总持续时间可被 60 整除的歌曲",
  "status": "published",
  "qualityGate": "tested",
  "batch": "batch-015",
  "studyTags": [
    "数组",
    "哈希表",
    "计数"
  ],
  "summary": "统计下标 i<j 且两首歌时长之和能被六十整除的歌曲对数量。",
  "insight": "扫描当前时长余数 r，此前可配对余数唯一是 (60-r)%60；先累加其频次再记录 r，天然保证下标顺序。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "余数零与余数零配对",
    "余数三十与三十配对",
    "必须先查询再增加当前频次避免自配对"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "remainder-complement-count",
      "title": "余数补数计数",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "用六十个余数桶在线统计配对。",
      "steps": [
        "frequency[60] 初始化零，answer=0",
        "对 duration，remainder=duration%60，complement=(60-remainder)%60",
        "answer+=frequency[complement]，再 frequency[remainder]++；返回 answer"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/remainder-complement-count/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/remainder-complement-count/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/remainder-complement-count/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
